{"overview":"در کانون اصلاح و تربیت «شهر زیبا» نوجوانان زندانی با خواست «اعلا» جمع می‌شوند تا هجدهمین سالروز تولد «اکبر» را جشن بگیرند. اکبر متهم است دو سال پیش دختری را کشته و حالا زمان قصاص اوست. اعلا، دوست اکبر، برای کمک به او به اتفاق «فیروزه»، خواهر اکبر برای گرفتن رضایت به سراغ شاکی پرونده، «ابوالقاسم» (پدر مقتول) می‌روند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Akbar, 18, has been held in a rehabilitation centre for committing murder at the age of sixteen. Now, Akbar is transferred to prison to await the day of his execution. A’la, a friend of Akbar, tries desperately to gain the consent of Akbar’s plaintiff so as to stop the execution.","tagline_en":"","runtime":101,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["اصغر فرهادی"],"crew_en":["Asghar Farhadi"],"countries":["IR"],"cast":[{"name":"ترانه علیدوستی","role":"Firoozeh","photo":"/wJ3HXppi15kLope4n0i2JaVxCaQ.jpg","en":"Taraneh Alidoosti"},{"name":"Babak Ansari","role":"A'la","photo":"/mbmnpSKMZGDnEEk39sRiu8FTrXJ.jpg"},{"name":"Faramarz Gharibian","role":"Abolqasem Rahmati","photo":"/kVvYmkcJ9r7BXX1eJS8nXVPcubR.jpg"},{"name":"آهو خردمند","role":"Abolqasem's Wife","photo":"/72gT2Hd4qUiQSgJtLOXx2gyG03d.jpg","en":"Ahoo Kheradmand"},{"name":"Hossein Farzi-Zadeh","role":"Akbar","photo":"/rGORj6bnseKpok5ZenroDW0afeV.jpg"},{"name":"فرهاد قائمیان","role":"","photo":"/5zHmRK13o64BXRtI3xSxAoYD0R4.jpg","en":"Farhad Ghaemian"}],"trailer":"8hi2cirzz-U","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/89065-shhr-zyb/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Film Movement Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/c8H4Jp8qInInqkPSryR80rb7jYO.png"},{"n":"Film Movement Plus Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/zy8e5KYnkpB8qbLJUvzMnaynBSZ.png"},{"n":"Kanopy","kind":"free","logo":"/cltb8XKan9ierp23ItPmCOcVLRa.png"},{"n":"Hoopla","kind":"free","logo":"/gtjNBzAoGgUtYzt0UKXmwG34WWL.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"rent","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"rent","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"